#: src/lib/fcitx/globalconfig.cpp:219
msgid ""
"Override the XKB option from display server. It will not affect the XKB "
"option send to display, but just the XKB options for custom XKB layout. This "
"is a workaround when there is no way to get the current XKB option from "
"Wayland Compositor."
